{'symbol': 'NKE', 'date': '2022-09-21 07:00:00', 'title': 'MÓNICA GIL AND BOB SWAN JOIN NIKE, INC. BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "BEAVERTON, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NIKE, INC. (NYSE:NKE) TODAY ANNOUNCED MÓNICA GIL AND BOB SWAN HAVE BEEN APPOINTED TO THE COMPANY'S BOARD OF DIRECTORS. GIL IS CHIEF ADMINISTRATIVE AND MARKETING OFFICER OF NBCUNIVERSAL TELEMUNDO ENTERPRISES. SWAN IS AN OPERATING PARTNER AT ANDREESSEN HOROWITZ AND FORMER CEO OF INTEL CORPORATION. “MÓNICA AND BOB'S COLLECTIVE LEADERSHIP IN BUSINESS OPERATIONS, INNOVATION, MARKETING, BRANDING AND MEDIA MAKE THEM OUTSTANDING ADDITIONS TO OUR BOARD,” SAID MARK PARKE"}